<v Ira Glass>Thanks as always to our programs co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he was watching this documentary on rock and roll in the '60s, but it complained it was taking them forever, forever, to get to The Rolling Stones.
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生。你知道，他当时在看一部关于60年代摇滚乐的纪录片，但他抱怨说，他们花了太久、太久的时间才讲到滚石乐队。

00:57:11.650 --> 00:57:14.140
<v Man>Oh, yeah, it was because you got to get through the doors.
<v Man>哦，是的，因为你得穿过那些门。

00:57:14.140 --> 00:57:18.660
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

